OL,3,GNEWSACrypto fraudster stole #250,000
OL,4,Afor spending spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman conned victims out of thousands
OL,7,Fof pounds before spending almost
OL,8,F#250,000 on jewellery, travel, home
OL,9,Fimprovements, vehicles and takeaway
OL,10,Ffood.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police said Faisa Ali
OL,13,Ftook money from a large number of
OL,14,Finvestors for her cryptocurrency
OL,15,Fcompany, from 2021 to 2023, and made
OL,16,Fguarantees their cash could not be
OL,17,Flost.
OL,19,FHowever, she sent a text message to the
OL,20,Finvestor WhatsApp group in March 2023,
OL,21,Fwhich stated she had made poor
OL,22,Fdecisions and lost all their money.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
